## Local Nginx Setup Guide

Assuming your webroot directory is configured at `/var/www/stefanoshood`:

1. **Clone or Copy files** into your web root directory.
2. **Configure Nginx Server Block** (`/etc/nginx/sites-available/stefanoshood`):
   ```nginx
   server {
       listen 80;
       server_name localhost;
       root /var/www/stefanoshood;
       index index.php index.html index.htm;

       location / {
           try_files $uri $uri/ =404;
       }

       location ~ \.php$ {
           include snippets/fastcgi-php.conf;
           fastcgi_pass unix:/var/run/php/php8.1-fpm.sock; # Adjust PHP version as needed
           fastcgi_param SCRIPT_FILENAME $document_root$fastcgi_script_name;
           include fastcgi_params;
       }
   }